<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Heavy-Metal on Blog de Pocallum — camera &amp; action!</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/tag/heavy-metal/</link><description>Recent content in Heavy-Metal on Blog de Pocallum — camera &amp; action!</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ca</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 16 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/tag/heavy-metal/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>2026-03-13 - Nit de bruixes amb Whitedemon + Indar al Casal de barri de Prosperitat</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2026/03/16/2026-03-13-nit-de-bruixes-amb-whitedemon-indar-al-casal-de-barri-de-prosperitat/</link><pubDate>Mon, 16 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2026/03/16/2026-03-13-nit-de-bruixes-amb-whitedemon-indar-al-casal-de-barri-de-prosperitat/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/ojeZtSi5cMjwzGRa6"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/DSCF4026-1024x683.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aquest passat divendres dia 13 el metal va arribar al Casal de Barri de Prosperitat de la mà de dues bandes ben joves que van convertir la vetllada en tota una nit de bruixes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La nit va començar amb el groove metal atmosfèric de &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/whitedemonofc/"&gt;@whitedemonofc&lt;/a&gt; i, després d’un petit parèntesi, va continuar amb &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/indar_band/"&gt;@indar_band&lt;/a&gt; i el seu metall progressiu.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La proposta, a més d’acontentar el públic més heavy metal de tot Can Fanga i rodalies, demostrava una cosa ben clara: això no és només cosa de “iaios peluts&amp;quot;. El públic —ben transversal— cobria pràcticament totes les franges d’edat.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2025-03-22 - Prospehell Metal Fest al Casal de Joves de Prosperitat</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2025/03/24/2025-03-22-prospehell-metal-fest-al-casal-de-joves-de-prosperitat/</link><pubDate>Mon, 24 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2025/03/24/2025-03-22-prospehell-metal-fest-al-casal-de-joves-de-prosperitat/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/DYkXzwXFGRoUeG9u7"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/DSCF0272-1024x683.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aquest dissabte, intens dissabte, va tocar passar-se a lluir el pel (o la falta d&amp;rsquo;aquest en el meu cas) pel &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/cjprospe/"&gt;Casal de Joves de Prosperitat&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Allà es va celebrar el &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/metal.nightmare/p/DHbT_BOiMOq/?api=%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%BB%E6%89%BE%E5%B0%8F%E5%A7%90%E5%BF%AB%E9%A4%90%E5%85%A8%E5%A5%97%E4%B8%8A%E9%97%A8%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%7B%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A11646224%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%8A%E9%97%A8%7D-%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%BB%E5%93%AA%E9%87%8C%E6%9C%89%E5%B0%8F%E5%A7%90%E5%BF%AB%E9%A4%90%E5%85%A8%E5%A5%97%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1-%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%BB%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E6%89%BE%E5%85%A8%E5%A5%97%E5%B0%8F%E5%A7%90%E4%B8%8A%E9%97%A8%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1-%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%BB%E5%90%8C%E5%9F%8E%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%BF%AB%E9%A4%90%E5%85%A8%E5%A5%97%E5%B0%8F%E5%A7%90%E4%B8%8A%E9%97%A8%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1.muhz&amp;amp;hl=pa"&gt;Prospehell Metal Fest&lt;/a&gt; que ve a ser un aquelarre de peluts fent molt soroll i gent rockanrolejant a tope. Serà la meva veterania, però va sorpendrem gratament la curta edat dels membres de les formacions que vaig poder veure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Com sempre que vaig al Casal de Joves també vaig coincidir amb els coleguis no tan joves del barri i vàrem compartir una bona estona.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2023-06-03 – Festa major de Prosperitat – Dissabte</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/06/04/2023-06-03-festa-major-de-prosperitat-dissabte/</link><pubDate>Sun, 04 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/06/04/2023-06-03-festa-major-de-prosperitat-dissabte/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/ukASj1eL2JKJ3wX17"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/l51sF3uYTxxy2OhbfUlUompZcwAte_XEskyLzUmJs8U6FDOyxvioTKtM1eYIzj6G6E1lQ92gWlrG8nlLu0dlKooDkeSqm8bycWzhe0tYlkDUhyUR7hfv2eFBX234SnFG4FlmQcGUXmj2QL05IzGa-9t5wCuI4jMpmFkl_0uC27dYPYHPXdcLceS_hKI-X4-I8XPY3or1nWJxDDqQMvoe5zYnhkphCnIOTgI5M7uLOHAjplf4eldDc2EgBnEnF27_KrW9hdNQKpJaFgIRP-xnCK0ovSIlGVhaqiESdTLnUBST9kCEGwAmwhRKH0OJRy4dVMTaPS-Ob4lp5gLOEuXcKLiBmh0jbIC6DLI5OxogedxiJjjzknFsZ4NCm-Io1LxS9jScaAFld1wg2AmVjqtaO4mKze4mv31GforodO2Ms_6j1Ml8jW-xHcuJQTJT2E-1B9CRa9T6quam2YsE1IDz2KAEsS-R4846dJqYyVnaW9uy4xS2hjmti5xVpHNOSsJsErm8TjkDDmyn-Ao4haxzyYNxG-d574p-cA5HLj2KlovgA7fQOlbsAJQd8VaV5ACuDLxvliZVaAYPrfv39idZia4j2HNOXzZwfZTymHGnRAQYie4Skinryzn7irh84-O5B-N0FvpL6XaS9pf6Zka1RTM8jtjx1Ztt9ysP-RexsV99kdfQBlttiqU_O7ycWS9mKBwk8FFNeIA-HAOTNkJL9_AKvxgglMk-rpCLDIphi-EPBYuGQuHsD3yNBJkA4tJus4HpHD8rUNGCof_dzv1qlO7wQragfaZEBBqiAU0loNfTM4qwJDM2cE8lX0F-oUwptwnccaDIW8tVGd_jVVjB3UWSukyaf2k14Lvp_pi8R4jXDnrtjjhjREnOGZvnF1e9UKoQ0l__RGDKwxyHZ0xMC-roQ72eiJ2J_rFQAm54NQwNnA=w1734-h1156-s-no?authuser=0" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
